SyncPatch NOTICE
================

This project provides patches for use with Morphe (app.morphe.patcher).
References to Morphe are made solely for descriptive compatibility purposes
and do not suggest authorship by, or affiliation with, the Morphe project.

The Morphe Patcher library (app.morphe:morphe-patcher) is licensed under the
GNU General Public License v3.0; see LICENSE. It is not redistributed here;
the build resolves it from the Morphe GitHub Packages registry. A legacy copy
remains in libs/ for offline use by the validator development tool.

The patch targets Sync for Reddit (Laurence Dawson). The patches modify the
app at build time on the user's own device and are not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or sponsored by the app's developer.

The "Predictive back gesture (manifest)" sub-patch is derived from HK Morphe
Patches (https://github.com/humzakh/HK-Morphe-Patches/), also licensed under
GPLv3, with the MainActivity exclusion deliberately removed so predictive
back covers app exit as well.
